@startuml ui-flow
!theme plain
hide empty description
title Tolksyn - User Interface Flow

[*] --> Capture
Capture --> Confirm : Capture or import image\nExtraction finishes
Confirm --> Capture : Discard or sent/queued
Confirm --> Confirm : Edit fields\nRetry extraction
Capture --> History : Open recent attempts
History --> Confirm : Open attempt details
Capture --> Settings : Configure provider\ningest and options
Settings --> Capture : Return to scanning
@enduml
